  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Automatic differentiation with inference by default (reverse-mode graph construction opt-in via GradientUtils.Grad()) and a full differentiable NN module system — Linear, Sequential, Embedding, SparseEmbedding, Conv1d (im2col, PyTorch-compatible layout), Conv2d (grouped conv, 1x1 fast path), ConvTranspose2d, BatchNorm1d/2d, LayerNorm, DepthwiseSeparableConv2d, TransformerBlock (RMSNorm/LayerNorm + GELU), MultiheadAttention, VAE/ConvVAE, MaxPool2d, AdaptiveAvgPool2d, GELU. Type constraint relaxed to IFloatingPointIeee754<T> (float/double/Half/BFloat16); all differentiable operations span-ified over TensorPrimitives; SIMD-accelerated Adam/AdamW/RMSNorm/LayerNorm/GELU kernels; ArrayPool-backed gradient accumulation. Training stack: SGD/Adam/AdamW optimizers, TrainingLoop, DataParallelTrainer, ModelSerializer (StateDict/LoadStateDict). 55 PyTorch-validated functional tests (NivaraTorch). Core columnar engine unchanged: LINQ-like query engine, tensor-accelerated arithmetic and comparisons, lazy/eager/streaming/parallel execution strategies, explicit null mask semantics, schema-aware query planning with predicate pushdown and operation fusion, performance diagnostics, buffer pooling.",
